                        "review": "12 is Better Than 6 is a short and pretty neat game, well worth picking up on sale. Getting 100% is also fairly easy, so there’s no tedious grind to worry about. The art style is cool, too, and fits the game really well.\n\nI found it a little difficult at times, but maybe I’m just bad at it. Either way, I think a no-death achievement would’ve been really damn cool, because I definitely would’ve gone for it.",
